{
  "note": "Curated CC0 sounds for the built-in sound library. tools/build-sounds.mjs converts each `src` (under work/sounds-raw, downloaded from OpenGameArt by the owner-approved CC0 search, 2026-10-30) to assets/sounds/<id>.wav (48 kHz mono PCM16, silence trimmed, peak -1 dBFS) and writes assets/sounds/manifest.json with provenance. `maxSec` cuts long loops/beds.",
